   c) Advertising or promoting a Derivative Work as "made by you" without the credit in section 2 is a violation.

4. CELESTE SERVICES
   The servers and services run for Celeste Overlay (community feed, roles and badges, account linking, update and
   statistics endpoints) are provided only to official builds published at https://github.com/atiyim/celeste-overlay/releases.
   Derivative Works must not connect to them, and must not copy or imitate the build signature used to identify
   official builds. You must run your own services for your own versions.

